Dust Storm conjures a violent whirlwind of choking dust that engulfs all
enemies in the area. The swirling particles tear at exposed flesh and fill
the lungs of anyone caught in the maelstrom.

Usage: cast 'dust storm'

This area effect spell damages all non-group members in the room. While
the damage from each individual particle is modest, the cumulative effect
on multiple enemies makes it useful for crowd control situations.

Dust Storm cannot be cast underwater, as there is no air to carry the
dust. A critical success doubles the spell's damage as the storm becomes
particularly intense.

Class: Mage
Discipline: Air

